# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The web over the 6T's mobile data (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.web): once the data session is up (en1), a name resolved, a page
# over plain TCP, and pages over CFNetwork's HTTPS (TLS, the trust store, trustd) -- what Safari needs below WebKit.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 60
/redwood/bin/net_test show reach www.google.com resolve www.google.com tcp www.google.com 80
/redwood/bin/net_test fetch https://www.google.com/ fetch https://example.com/ fetch http://example.com/
